{"resourceIdentifier":"5436","resourceName":"CATANDUVA LANDFILL GAS PROJECT","description":"The proposed VCS project activity titled “Catanduva Landfill Gas Project” encompasses the promotion of collection and destruction/utilization of landfill gas (LFG) (rich in methane (CH4 at the Centro de Gerenciamento de Resíduos (CGR) Catanduva landfill landfill (hereby termed “Catanduva landfill”) through destruction of collected LFG in a high temperature open flare and utilization of collected LFG as gaseous fuel in a set of 2 engine-generator sets (to be gradually implemented) which represent the major components of an electricity generation infrastructure with a total combined nameplate installed capacity of about 2.8 MW.","location":{"latitude":-21.123247,"longitude":-48.928236},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2025-02-14","endExclusive":"2025-03-17","endInclusive":"2025-03-16"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"5436"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"São Paulo"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"UniCarbo Energia e Biogas Ltda."},{"type":"string","value":"SP, Brazil"},{"type":"string","value":"+5511985960950"},{"type":"string","value":"nuno@unicarbo.com.br"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"109042"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"LGAI Technological Center, S.A. (Applus+ Certification)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"26/11/2025"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/06/202